rning/how-to-inference-server-http?view=azureml-api-2)\n\n## Support\n- [Troubleshooting Guide](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/how-to-troubleshoot-prebuilt-docker-image-inference)\n\n## License\n\nLegal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice). By downloading these images, you agree to the terms of the license agreement.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2024-01-09T16:09:14.4520189+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"206K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"20230313.v1","digest":"sha256:0975f7591306fa05ba29f690b1842b9abd196d6e9abeec9c1b9ad27296248101","pushed":"2023-03-14T17:12:53.0000000+00:00","size":12046,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:0975f7591306fa05ba29f690b1842b9abd196d6e9abeec9c1b9ad27296248101","pushed":"2023-03-14T17:12:03.0000000+00:00","size":12046,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20230306.v3","digest":"sha256:26b1ddce5fb610979acd14f8c81b979387f6d9ba9340a6e16ba7950fba26e91e","pushed":"2023-03-06T22:08:58.0000000+00:00","size":12057,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20230227.v2","digest":"sha256:d3eb5e43fed557bf12863402ba93365aaaa9a95255bc725b39efd6f001dc5ccc","pushed":"2023-02-28T05:58:40.0000000+00:00","size":12043,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20230222.v5","digest":"sha256:660582217a913e0268e611984e2e7b3fd4a2bb096afe69ad1a7f9e7b350bb12c","pushed":"2023-02-23T00:06:35.0000000+00:00","size":12013,"pla